  "Enrollment needs at least one purpose the subject agreed to.": "注册至少需要一个数据主体同意的用途。",
  "Every consent grant for this subject has lapsed. The sealed template was purged. Re-enrollment needs fresh consent.": "该数据主体的所有同意均已失效。密封模板已清除。重新注册需要新的同意。",
  "Facility access": "设施门禁",
  "Fairlearn is an optional Python hook and is not invoked. The local TypeScript metrics are the MVP result.": "Fairlearn 是可选的 Python 钩子，未被调用。本地 TypeScript 指标即为 MVP 结果。",
  "Fides refused the consent receipt. The subject was not enrolled.": "Fides 拒绝了同意回执。数据主体未被注册。",
  "Fixture {0} has no cohort metadata. Cohorts are assigned on the fixture card and are never inferred from biometrics.": "样本 {0} 没有群组元数据。群组在样本卡片上指定，从不根据生物特征推断。",
  "Geo routing is off. Country and site-category labels stay unused.": "地理路由已关闭。国家和网站类别标签不会被使用。",
  "Geo routing settings are not configured on this process.": "此进程未配置地理路由设置。",
  "Group labels are short cohort keys, not names or inferred demographics.": "群组标签是简短的群组键，不是姓名，也不是推断出的人口统计信息。",
