  "Infinitum Corporation®": "Infinitum Corporation®",
  "InsightFace pretrained weights are often limited to noncommercial research. ei·det·ic™ does not download or ship those weights. MATCHER_MODE stays mock for CI. Set INSIGHTFACE_LICENSE_ACCEPTED=true only when you hold a license, and set INSIGHTFACE_URL to a sidecar inside the sealed boundary.": "InsightFace 预训练权重通常仅限非商业研究使用。ei·det·ic™ 不会下载或分发这些权重。MATCHER_MODE 在 CI 中保持 mock。仅在持有许可证时才设置 INSIGHTFACE_LICENSE_ACCEPTED=true，并将 INSIGHTFACE_URL 设置为密封边界内的边车服务。",
  "InsightFace sidecar similarity {0} for a synthetic fixture. The descriptor stayed in the sidecar.": "InsightFace 边车服务对合成样本给出的相似度为 {0}。描述符保留在边车服务中。",
  "InsightFace stays behind a licensed adapter. Weights are often noncommercial, so this MVP defaults to mock mode and does not download them.": "InsightFace 保留在经许可的适配器之后。其权重通常仅限非商业用途，因此本 MVP 默认使用 mock 模式，不会下载权重。",
  "Jordan Blake": "Jordan Blake",
