  "MediaPipe could not load its local graphics library. Install libegl1 and libgl1, then retry. This is not a Google Cloud call.": "MediaPipe 无法加载本地图形库。请安装 libegl1 和 libgl1 后重试。这不是 Google Cloud 调用。",
  "MediaPipe did not find a face above the capture threshold. The enroll stopped. This check does not identify anyone.": "MediaPipe 未发现超过采集阈值的人脸。注册已停止。此检查不识别任何人。",
  "MediaPipe face detector found one face at confidence {0}. This is a presence check, not an identity match.": "MediaPipe 人脸检测器发现一张人脸，置信度为 {0}。这是存在性检查，不是身份匹配。",
  "MediaPipe found more than one face. Enrollment capture expects a single subject.": "MediaPipe 发现多张人脸。注册采集要求只有一个数据主体。",
  "MediaPipe is not installed for this Python. Install packages/matcher/python/requirements-mediapipe.txt. The check runs locally and does not call Google Cloud.": "此 Python 未安装 MediaPipe。请安装 packages/matcher/python/requirements-mediapipe.txt。该检查在本地运行，不调用 Google Cloud。",
