  "OpenCV Zoo accepts a synthetic portrait PNG, or an operator capture when that flag is on. Fixture tokens stay on the mock matcher. Public-figure photographs are refused.": "OpenCV Zoo 接受合成肖像 PNG，或在该标志开启时接受操作员采集的图像。样本令牌仍使用模拟匹配器。公众人物照片会被拒绝。",
