  "Search refused. This subject has not granted consent for this purpose and dataset. The match did not run.": "搜索被拒绝。该数据主体未就此用途和数据集授予同意。未执行匹配。",
  "SFace cosine {0} computed inside the matcher. The embedding stays in the sealed store.": "SFace 余弦值 {0} 在匹配器内计算。嵌入向量保留在密封存储中。",
